<title>GERMANY: Hypo-Bank - no plans raise F&amp;C stake further.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank - no plans raise F&amp;C stake further.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG, Germany's fifth-largest commercial bank, said on Thursday that it had no current plans to raise its stake further in U.K. asset management group Foreign &amp; Colonial Management Limited.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not plan at present to increase the stake in F&amp;C,&quot; managment board member Martin Koelsch said in answer to a question.</p>
<p>The bank this morning announced it plans to raise the stake in the group from 50 to 65 percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
